WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:04.840
Estás...

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.160
You’re a psycho.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:08.640
Anthony!

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.040
Anthony, I’m here!

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.000
He can’t hear you.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.800
So, let's continue

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.520
discussing our business.

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.200
There is nothing to discuss.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.040
You're insane.

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.920
Anthony!

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.200
According to the reports,

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.320
the hotel industry will grow

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:39.800
in the next few years.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:41.840
I already found an investor

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.360
who is ready to put the money

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:44.960
into this project.

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:46.400
But we have to act fast.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.320
So, sign it.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:06.760
And who is the investor?

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:09.840
Wouldn't it happen to be a brother,

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:10.240
would it?

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:11.440
It doesn't matter.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.760
You want me to do this, right?

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:22.440
So, then you have to explain me

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:25.880
everything about your project.

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:27.200
I'm not going to sign up for

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:28.520
something I don't understand.

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:31.520
I'm afraid we don't have time for that.

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:34.040
I was studying business for years.

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:36.000
I'm not in a hurry.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.040
You're the one who need this, not me.

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:42.440
So, ready to teach

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:44.280
a spoiled girl about business?
